# Hash-locked research artifacts must be byte-identical on every OS, so line-ending
# conversion is disabled for them only. Without this, Git on Windows (core.autocrlf=true)
# converts LF to CRLF on checkout and the published SHA256 checks fail (PROJECT_AUDIT.md R6).
# Every other text file gets Git's normal handling (stored with LF).
docs/engineering-log/*.json           -text
astra-platform/data/**/*.json         -text
astra-platform/data/*.csv             -text
astra-platform/public/data/*.json     -text
data/*.json                           -text
models/saved/*.json                   -text
lineage.json                          -text

# Binary data and model files
*.npy     binary
*.npz     binary
*.onnx    binary
*.pt      binary
*.sqlite  binary
